```console
$ scherzo-cloud auth identities list --help
List linked sign-in identities

Usage: scherzo-cloud auth identities list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>        Maximum items to return (1-200)
      --cursor <CURSOR>      Opaque continuation cursor
      --json                 Print the identity result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
